<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Robert Half Int'l.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Robert Half Int'l.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Robert Half International Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Robert Half gained 1-5/8 to 38-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
